            <ArticleTitle>[Effects of diet therapy including eiconol on clinical and metabolic parameters in patients with type 2 diabetes mellitus].</ArticleTitle>
            <Pagination>
                <MedlinePgn>36-9</MedlinePgn>
            </Pagination>
            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>It was investigated the influence of a diet supplemented with PUFA omega-3 (&quot;Eiconol&quot;) on dynamic of basal and postprandial glycemia, blood pressure, lipid levels, parameters of lipid peroxidation in 60 patients with non-insulin-dependent diabetes mellitus. Fish oil (&quot;Eiconol&quot;) was used as a dietary supplement of PUFA omega-3. The results of investigations indicated that a diet supplemented with &quot;Eiconol&quot; (8 g/day) increased the effect of dietary therapy in correction of essential hypertension and atherogenic lipids. It was not the worsening of the glycemia and activation of lipid peroxidation.</AbstractText>
            </Abstract>
